# 跑馬燈模組：插在 iCEBreaker 的 PMOD1A 上（Runner，src/runner.veryl）
# 74HC595 移位暫存器帶 8 顆 LED：FPGA 只用三支腳（SER、SRCLK、RCLK）
board "PMOD runner"

part J1 pmod
part U1 74hc595
part D0 led
part D1 led
part D2 led
part D3 led
part D4 led
part D5 led
part D6 led
part D7 led
part R0 res 330
part R1 res 330
part R2 res 330
part R3 res 330
part R4 res 330
part R5 res 330
part R6 res 330
part R7 res 330

net SER   J1.3 U1.SER
net SRCLK J1.4 U1.SRCLK
net RCLK  J1.7 U1.RCLK
net 3V3   J1.6 J1.12 U1.VCC U1.MR_N
net GND   J1.5 J1.11 U1.GND U1.OE_N R0.2 R1.2 R2.2 R3.2 R4.2 R5.2 R6.2 R7.2

net Q0 U1.Q0 D0.A
net Q1 U1.Q1 D1.A
net Q2 U1.Q2 D2.A
net Q3 U1.Q3 D3.A
net Q4 U1.Q4 D4.A
net Q5 U1.Q5 D5.A
net Q6 U1.Q6 D6.A
net Q7 U1.Q7 D7.A
net K0 D0.K R0.1
net K1 D1.K R1.1
net K2 D2.K R2.1
net K3 D3.K R3.1
net K4 D4.K R4.1
net K5 D5.K R5.1
net K6 D6.K R6.1
net K7 D7.K R7.1

plug J1 icebreaker.PMOD1A
